BT /F2 15 Tf 54 722 Td (1. Project Background) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 674 Td (Cross-language video localization is still expensive and slow for individual creators,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 658 Td (educators, and small media teams. A typical workflow requires subtitle generation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 642 Td (manual translation, voice-over recording, audio alignment, and final video rendering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 626 Td (This project reduces that friction by turning the full workflow into an end-to-end AI-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 610 Td (assisted pipeline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 578 Td (Video Voice Translator is a multimodal content creation tool built for Track 1 of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 562 Td (2026 AMD AI DevMaster Hackathon. It focuses on practical video dubbing and content) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 546 Td (repurposing: a user uploads a video, selects a target language, and receives a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 530 Td (translated dubbed output while preserving the original speaking style as closely as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 514 Td (possible.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54 482 Td (2. Target Users and Application Scenarios) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 434 Td (Target Users) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 386 Td (- Content creators who want to localize short videos quickly) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 370 Td (- Educators who need bilingual teaching materials) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 354 Td (- Small media teams producing English and Chinese versions of the same content) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 338 Td (- Product teams preparing multilingual demos for marketing or developer education) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 306 Td (Application Scenarios) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 258 Td (- Short-form social media video localization) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 242 Td (- Technical tutorial dubbing) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 226 Td (- Course content adaptation between English and Chinese) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 210 Td (- Demo video preparation for product launches or developer showcases) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54 178 Td (3. System Architecture) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 130 Td (The system uses a split frontend/backend architecture with a dedicated worker for long-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 114 Td (running media jobs.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 82 Td (Architecture Components) Tj ET
endstream
