BT /F2 10 Tf 54 812 Td (Video Voice Translator - Track 1 Project Profile) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 500 22 Td (Page 2 / 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 738 Td (- **Frontend**: React + TypeScript + Vite) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 722 Td (- **Backend API**: FastAPI) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 706 Td (- **Background execution**: worker process for translation tasks) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 690 Td (- **Media processing**: FFmpeg-based extraction and synthesis) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 674 Td (- **Persistent task state**: JSON task records under `data/task_states/`) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 658 Td (- **Output storage**: generated task outputs under `data/outputs/`) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 626 Td (Execution Flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 578 Td (1. User uploads a video or audio file in the Web UI) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 562 Td (2. Backend registers the task and stores upload metadata) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 546 Td (3. Worker executes the nine-stage translation pipeline) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 530 Td (4. Progress and status are exposed through the API) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 514 Td (5. Final media and task artifacts are stored on disk) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 498 Td (6. Completed jobs can be reopened later through the history panel) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54 466 Td (4. Model and Algorithm Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 418 Td (The full pipeline contains the following AI and media processing stages:) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 386 Td (4.1 Audio Extraction and Normalization) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 338 Td (The input media is normalized into a consistent audio representation using FFmpeg. This) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 322 Td (step ensures later stages receive a predictable sample rate and channel layout.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 290 Td (4.2 Vocal Separation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 242 Td (The system separates vocals and background audio to improve speech recognition quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 226 Td (and to preserve ambient content for the final dubbed output.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 194 Td (4.3 Speech Recognition) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 146 Td (Speech is transcribed with Whisper-family models. This branch defaults to the native) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 130 Td (`whisper` backend because it is more suitable for the AMD/ROCm environment used in this) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 114 Td (project. Timestamped segments are generated for alignment.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 82 Td (4.4 Text Translation) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
