BT /F2 10 Tf 54 812 Td (Video Voice Translator - Track 1 Project Profile) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 500 22 Td (Page 3 / 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 738 Td (The recognized transcript is translated in batches via **DeepSeek-V4-Flash** served from) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 722 Td (the AMD Radeon developer TokenFactory endpoint) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 706 Td (\(`https://developer.amd.com.cn/radeon/tokenfactory`\). The translation layer uses an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 690 Td (OpenAI-compatible client with retry logic and response validation to improve robustness) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 674 Td (when segment-level responses are inconsistent.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 642 Td (4.5 Voice Cloning) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 594 Td (Translated segments are synthesized with IndexTTS2. Reference audio is extracted from) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 578 Td (the source material so the output keeps a similar speaker identity and speaking style.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 546 Td (4.6 Audio Merging and Video Rendering) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 498 Td (The synthesized clips are aligned back to the original timeline, merged with preserved) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 482 Td (background audio, and rendered into the final translated video.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54 450 Td (5. AMD Radeon / ROCm Adaptation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 402 Td (This project was adjusted specifically for AMD GPU execution:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 370 Td (- The default ASR backend is native `whisper` instead of `faster-whisper`, which reduces) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 354 Td (  compatibility issues on ROCm in this branch.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 338 Td (- `IndexTTS2` uses FP16 for performance, while disabling CUDA-only kernels that are not) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 322 Td (  appropriate for ROCm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 306 Td (- The installation scripts attempt to prepare ROCm-compatible PyTorch automatically on) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 290 Td (  AMD cloud machines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 274 Td (- The system isolates long-running translation tasks into a worker process to improve) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 258 Td (  runtime stability during demos.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 242 Td (- Progress and result persistence reduce the chance of losing demo visibility after a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 226 Td (  frontend refresh or server restart.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54 194 Td (6. Core Features and User Experience) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 146 Td (- Web-based upload and translation workflow) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 130 Td (- Support for English and Chinese translation directions) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 114 Td (- Translation history with reopen and delete actions) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 98 Td (- Progress updates across major pipeline stages) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 82 Td (- Final result replay in the browser) Tj ET
endstream
