BT /F1 11 Tf 54 674 Td (and dubbed output through a reproducible pipeline, a usable Web UI, and a practical set) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 658 Td (of scripts for setup and judging. The project is aimed at making multilingual video) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 642 Td (creation faster, more accessible, and easier to demonstrate on AMD Radeon GPU) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 626 Td (environments.) Tj ET
